{"page":323,"verses":[{"verse_key":"21:11","surah":21,"ayah":11,"ar_uthmani":"وَكَمْ قَصَمْنَا مِن قَرْيَةٍ كَانَتْ ظَالِمَةً وَأَنشَأْنَا بَعْدَهَا قَوْمًا ءَاخَرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"How many communities of evildoers We have destroyed! How many others We have raised up in their places!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَكَمْ","en_gloss":"And how many","transliteration":"wakam","verse_key":"21:11"},{"pos":2,"ar":"قَصَمْنَا","en_gloss":"We (have) shattered","transliteration":"qaṣamnā","verse_key":"21:11"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"21:11"},{"pos":4,"ar":"قَرْيَةٍۢ","en_gloss":"a town","transliteration":"qaryatin","verse_key":"21:11"},{"pos":5,"ar":"كَانَتْ","en_gloss":"(that) was","transliteration":"kānat","verse_key":"21:11"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ظَالِمَةًۭ","en_gloss":"unjust","transliteration":"ẓālimatan","verse_key":"21:11"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَأَنشَأْنَا","en_gloss":"and We produced","transliteration":"wa-anshanā","verse_key":"21:11"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بَعْدَهَا","en_gloss":"after them","transliteration":"baʿdahā","verse_key":"21:11"},{"pos":9,"ar":"قَوْمًا","en_gloss":"another people","transliteration":"qawman","verse_key":"21:11"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ءَاخَرِينَ","en_gloss":"another people","transliteration":"ākharīna","verse_key":"21:11"},{"pos":11,"ar":"١١","en_gloss":"(11)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:11"}]},{"verse_key":"21:12","surah":21,"ayah":12,"ar_uthmani":"فَلَمَّآ أَحَسُّوا۟ بَأْسَنَآ إِذَا هُم مِّنْهَا يَرْكُضُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When they felt Our might coming upon them, see how they tried to escape it!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَلَمَّآ","en_gloss":"Then when","transliteration":"falammā","verse_key":"21:12"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَحَسُّوا۟","en_gloss":"they perceived","transliteration":"aḥassū","verse_key":"21:12"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بَأْسَنَآ","en_gloss":"Our torment","transliteration":"basanā","verse_key":"21:12"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِذَا","en_gloss":"behold","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"21:12"},{"pos":5,"ar":"هُم","en_gloss":"they","transliteration":"hum","verse_key":"21:12"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِّنْهَا","en_gloss":"from it","transliteration":"min'hā","verse_key":"21:12"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَرْكُضُونَ","en_gloss":"were fleeing","transliteration":"yarkuḍūna","verse_key":"21:12"},{"pos":8,"ar":"١٢","en_gloss":"(12)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:12"}]},{"verse_key":"21:13","surah":21,"ayah":13,"ar_uthmani":"لَا تَرْكُضُوا۟ وَٱرْجِعُوٓا۟ إِلَىٰ مَآ أُتْرِفْتُمْ فِيهِ وَمَسَـٰكِنِكُمْ لَعَلَّكُمْ تُسْـَٔلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"‘Do not try to escape. Go back to your homes and the pleasure you revelled in: you may be questioned.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"Flee not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"21:13"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَرْكُضُوا۟","en_gloss":"Flee not","transliteration":"tarkuḍū","verse_key":"21:13"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَٱرْجِعُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"but return","transliteration":"wa-ir'jiʿū","verse_key":"21:13"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"21:13"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مَآ","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"21:13"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أُتْرِفْتُمْ","en_gloss":"you were given luxury","transliteration":"ut'rif'tum","verse_key":"21:13"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فِيهِ","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"fīhi","verse_key":"21:13"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَمَسَـٰكِنِكُمْ","en_gloss":"and to your homes","transliteration":"wamasākinikum","verse_key":"21:13"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لَعَلَّكُمْ","en_gloss":"so that you may","transliteration":"laʿallakum","verse_key":"21:13"},{"pos":10,"ar":"تُسْـَٔلُونَ","en_gloss":"be questioned","transliteration":"tus'alūna","verse_key":"21:13"},{"pos":11,"ar":"١٣","en_gloss":"(13)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:13"}]},{"verse_key":"21:14","surah":21,"ayah":14,"ar_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟ يَـٰوَيْلَنَآ إِنَّا كُنَّا ظَـٰلِمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They said, ‘Woe to us! We were wrong!’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"They said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"21:14"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَـٰوَيْلَنَآ","en_gloss":"O woe to us","transliteration":"yāwaylanā","verse_key":"21:14"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِنَّا","en_gloss":"Indeed, [we]","transliteration":"innā","verse_key":"21:14"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كُنَّا","en_gloss":"we were","transliteration":"kunnā","verse_key":"21:14"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ظَـٰلِمِينَ","en_gloss":"wrongdoers","transliteration":"ẓālimīna","verse_key":"21:14"},{"pos":6,"ar":"١٤","en_gloss":"(14)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:14"}]},{"verse_key":"21:15","surah":21,"ayah":15,"ar_uthmani":"فَمَا زَالَت تِّلْكَ دَعْوَىٰهُمْ حَتَّىٰ جَعَلْنَـٰهُمْ حَصِيدًا خَـٰمِدِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and that cry of theirs did not cease until We made them burnt-offstubble.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَمَا","en_gloss":"Then not","transliteration":"famā","verse_key":"21:15"},{"pos":2,"ar":"زَالَت","en_gloss":"ceased","transliteration":"zālat","verse_key":"21:15"},{"pos":3,"ar":"تِّلْكَ","en_gloss":"[this]","transliteration":"til'ka","verse_key":"21:15"},{"pos":4,"ar":"دَعْوَىٰهُمْ","en_gloss":"their cry","transliteration":"daʿwāhum","verse_key":"21:15"},{"pos":5,"ar":"حَتَّىٰ","en_gloss":"until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"21:15"},{"pos":6,"ar":"جَعَلْنَـٰهُمْ","en_gloss":"We made them","transliteration":"jaʿalnāhum","verse_key":"21:15"},{"pos":7,"ar":"حَصِيدًا","en_gloss":"reaped","transliteration":"ḥaṣīdan","verse_key":"21:15"},{"pos":8,"ar":"خَـٰمِدِينَ","en_gloss":"extinct","transliteration":"khāmidīna","verse_key":"21:15"},{"pos":9,"ar":"١٥","en_gloss":"(15)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:15"}]},{"verse_key":"21:16","surah":21,"ayah":16,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَا خَلَقْنَا ٱلسَّمَآءَ وَٱلْأَرْضَ وَمَا بَيْنَهُمَا لَـٰعِبِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We did not create the heavens and the earth and everything between them playfully.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"21:16"},{"pos":2,"ar":"خَلَقْنَا","en_gloss":"We created","transliteration":"khalaqnā","verse_key":"21:16"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَآءَ","en_gloss":"the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāa","verse_key":"21:16"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضَ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍa","verse_key":"21:16"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"21:16"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بَيْنَهُمَا","en_gloss":"(is) between them","transliteration":"baynahumā","verse_key":"21:16"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَـٰعِبِينَ","en_gloss":"(for) playing","transliteration":"lāʿibīna","verse_key":"21:16"},{"pos":8,"ar":"١٦","en_gloss":"(16)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:16"}]},{"verse_key":"21:17","surah":21,"ayah":17,"ar_uthmani":"لَوْ أَرَدْنَآ أَن نَّتَّخِذَ لَهْوًا لَّٱتَّخَذْنَـٰهُ مِن لَّدُنَّآ إِن كُنَّا فَـٰعِلِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If We had wished for a pastime, We could have found it within Us- if We had wished for any such thing.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَوْ","en_gloss":"If","transliteration":"law","verse_key":"21:17"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَرَدْنَآ","en_gloss":"We intended","transliteration":"aradnā","verse_key":"21:17"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"21:17"},{"pos":4,"ar":"نَّتَّخِذَ","en_gloss":"We take","transliteration":"nattakhidha","verse_key":"21:17"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَهْوًۭا","en_gloss":"a pastime","transliteration":"lahwan","verse_key":"21:17"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَّٱتَّخَذْنَـٰهُ","en_gloss":"surely We (could have) taken it","transliteration":"la-ittakhadhnāhu","verse_key":"21:17"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"21:17"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لَّدُنَّآ","en_gloss":"Us","transliteration":"ladunnā","verse_key":"21:17"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"if","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"21:17"},{"pos":10,"ar":"كُنَّا","en_gloss":"We were","transliteration":"kunnā","verse_key":"21:17"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فَـٰعِلِينَ","en_gloss":"doers","transliteration":"fāʿilīna","verse_key":"21:17"},{"pos":12,"ar":"١٧","en_gloss":"(17)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:17"}]},{"verse_key":"21:18","surah":21,"ayah":18,"ar_uthmani":"بَلْ نَقْذِفُ بِٱلْحَقِّ عَلَى ٱلْبَـٰطِلِ فَيَدْمَغُهُۥ فَإِذَا هُوَ زَاهِقٌ ۚ وَلَكُمُ ٱلْوَيْلُ مِمَّا تَصِفُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"No! We hurl the truth against falsehood, and truth obliterates it- see how falsehood vanishes away! Woe to you [people] for the way you describe God!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"بَلْ","en_gloss":"Nay","transliteration":"bal","verse_key":"21:18"},{"pos":2,"ar":"نَقْذِفُ","en_gloss":"We hurl","transliteration":"naqdhifu","verse_key":"21:18"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِٱلْحَقِّ","en_gloss":"the truth","transliteration":"bil-ḥaqi","verse_key":"21:18"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"against","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"21:18"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْبَـٰطِلِ","en_gloss":"[the] falsehood","transliteration":"l-bāṭili","verse_key":"21:18"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَيَدْمَغُهُۥ","en_gloss":"and it breaks its head","transliteration":"fayadmaghuhu","verse_key":"21:18"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَإِذَا","en_gloss":"behold","transliteration":"fa-idhā","verse_key":"21:18"},{"pos":8,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"it (is)","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"21:18"},{"pos":9,"ar":"زَاهِقٌۭ ۚ","en_gloss":"vanishing","transliteration":"zāhiqun","verse_key":"21:18"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَلَكُمُ","en_gloss":"And for you","transliteration":"walakumu","verse_key":"21:18"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْوَيْلُ","en_gloss":"(is) destruction","transliteration":"l-waylu","verse_key":"21:18"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مِمَّا","en_gloss":"for what","transliteration":"mimmā","verse_key":"21:18"},{"pos":13,"ar":"تَصِفُونَ","en_gloss":"you ascribe","transliteration":"taṣifūna","verse_key":"21:18"},{"pos":14,"ar":"١٨","en_gloss":"(18)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:18"}]},{"verse_key":"21:19","surah":21,"ayah":19,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَهُۥ مَن فِى ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ وَمَنْ عِندَهُۥ لَا يَسْتَكْبِرُونَ عَنْ عِبَادَتِهِۦ وَلَا يَسْتَحْسِرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Everyone in the heavens and earth belongs to Him, and those that are with Him are never too proud to worship Him, nor do they grow weary;","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَهُۥ","en_gloss":"And to Him (belongs)","transliteration":"walahu","verse_key":"21:19"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"whoever","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"21:19"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"21:19"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"21:19"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","verse_key":"21:19"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَمَنْ","en_gloss":"And (those) who","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"21:19"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عِندَهُۥ","en_gloss":"(are) near Him","transliteration":"ʿindahu","verse_key":"21:19"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"21:19"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يَسْتَكْبِرُونَ","en_gloss":"they are arrogant","transliteration":"yastakbirūna","verse_key":"21:19"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عَنْ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ʿan","verse_key":"21:19"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عِبَادَتِهِۦ","en_gloss":"worship Him","transliteration":"ʿibādatihi","verse_key":"21:19"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"21:19"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَسْتَحْسِرُونَ","en_gloss":"they tire","transliteration":"yastaḥsirūna","verse_key":"21:19"},{"pos":14,"ar":"١٩","en_gloss":"(19)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:19"}]},{"verse_key":"21:20","surah":21,"ayah":20,"ar_uthmani":"يُسَبِّحُونَ ٱلَّيْلَ وَٱلنَّهَارَ لَا يَفْتُرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"they glorify Him tirelessly night and day.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يُسَبِّحُونَ","en_gloss":"They glorify (Him)","transliteration":"yusabbiḥūna","verse_key":"21:20"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّيْلَ","en_gloss":"[the] night","transliteration":"al-layla","verse_key":"21:20"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَٱلنَّهَارَ","en_gloss":"and [the] day","transliteration":"wal-nahāra","verse_key":"21:20"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"21:20"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يَفْتُرُونَ","en_gloss":"they slacken","transliteration":"yafturūna","verse_key":"21:20"},{"pos":6,"ar":"٢٠","en_gloss":"(20)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:20"}]},{"verse_key":"21:21","surah":21,"ayah":21,"ar_uthmani":"أَمِ ٱتَّخَذُوٓا۟ ءَالِهَةً مِّنَ ٱلْأَرْضِ هُمْ يُنشِرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Have they chosen any gods from the earth who can give life to the dead?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَمِ","en_gloss":"Or","transliteration":"ami","verse_key":"21:21"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱتَّخَذُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"(have) they taken","transliteration":"ittakhadhū","verse_key":"21:21"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَالِهَةًۭ","en_gloss":"gods","transliteration":"ālihatan","verse_key":"21:21"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"21:21"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"21:21"},{"pos":6,"ar":"هُمْ","en_gloss":"they","transliteration":"hum","verse_key":"21:21"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يُنشِرُونَ","en_gloss":"raise (the dead)","transliteration":"yunshirūna","verse_key":"21:21"},{"pos":8,"ar":"٢١","en_gloss":"(21)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:21"}]},{"verse_key":"21:22","surah":21,"ayah":22,"ar_uthmani":"لَوْ كَانَ فِيهِمَآ ءَالِهَةٌ إِلَّا ٱللَّهُ لَفَسَدَتَا ۚ فَسُبْحَـٰنَ ٱللَّهِ رَبِّ ٱلْعَرْشِ عَمَّا يَصِفُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If there had been in the heavens or earth any gods but Him, both heavens and earth would be in ruins: God, Lord of the Throne, is far above the things they say:","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَوْ","en_gloss":"If","transliteration":"law","verse_key":"21:22"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"(there) were","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"21:22"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِيهِمَآ","en_gloss":"in both of them","transliteration":"fīhimā","verse_key":"21:22"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ءَالِهَةٌ","en_gloss":"gods","transliteration":"ālihatun","verse_key":"21:22"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"besides","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"21:22"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"21:22"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَفَسَدَتَا ۚ","en_gloss":"surely they (would) have been ruined","transliteration":"lafasadatā","verse_key":"21:22"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَسُبْحَـٰنَ","en_gloss":"So glorified","transliteration":"fasub'ḥāna","verse_key":"21:22"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(is) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"21:22"},{"pos":10,"ar":"رَبِّ","en_gloss":"Lord","transliteration":"rabbi","verse_key":"21:22"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْعَرْشِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Throne","transliteration":"l-ʿarshi","verse_key":"21:22"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَمَّا","en_gloss":"(above) what","transliteration":"ʿammā","verse_key":"21:22"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَصِفُونَ","en_gloss":"they attribute","transliteration":"yaṣifūna","verse_key":"21:22"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٢٢","en_gloss":"(22)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:22"}]},{"verse_key":"21:23","surah":21,"ayah":23,"ar_uthmani":"لَا يُسْـَٔلُ عَمَّا يَفْعَلُ وَهُمْ يُسْـَٔلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"He cannot be called to account for anything He does, whereas they will be called to account.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"21:23"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يُسْـَٔلُ","en_gloss":"He (can) be questioned","transliteration":"yus'alu","verse_key":"21:23"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَمَّا","en_gloss":"about what","transliteration":"ʿammā","verse_key":"21:23"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَفْعَلُ","en_gloss":"He does","transliteration":"yafʿalu","verse_key":"21:23"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَهُمْ","en_gloss":"but they","transliteration":"wahum","verse_key":"21:23"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يُسْـَٔلُونَ","en_gloss":"will be questioned","transliteration":"yus'alūna","verse_key":"21:23"},{"pos":7,"ar":"٢٣","en_gloss":"(23)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:23"}]},{"verse_key":"21:24","surah":21,"ayah":24,"ar_uthmani":"أَمِ ٱتَّخَذُوا۟ مِن دُونِهِۦٓ ءَالِهَةً ۖ قُلْ هَاتُوا۟ بُرْهَـٰنَكُمْ ۖ هَـٰذَا ذِكْرُ مَن مَّعِىَ وَذِكْرُ مَن قَبْلِى ۗ بَلْ أَكْثَرُهُمْ لَا يَعْلَمُونَ ٱلْحَقَّ ۖ فَهُم مُّعْرِضُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Have they chosen to worship other gods instead of Him? Say, ‘Bring your proof. This is the Scripture for those who are with me and the Scripture for those who went before me.’ But most of them do not recognize the truth, so they pay no heed.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَمِ","en_gloss":"Or","transliteration":"ami","verse_key":"21:24"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱتَّخَذُوا۟","en_gloss":"(have) they taken","transliteration":"ittakhadhū","verse_key":"21:24"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"besides Him","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"21:24"},{"pos":4,"ar":"دُونِهِۦٓ","en_gloss":"besides Him","transliteration":"dūnihi","verse_key":"21:24"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ءَالِهَةًۭ ۖ","en_gloss":"gods","transliteration":"ālihatan","verse_key":"21:24"},{"pos":6,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"21:24"},{"pos":7,"ar":"هَاتُوا۟","en_gloss":"Bring","transliteration":"hātū","verse_key":"21:24"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بُرْهَـٰنَكُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"your proof","transliteration":"bur'hānakum","verse_key":"21:24"},{"pos":9,"ar":"هَـٰذَا","en_gloss":"This","transliteration":"hādhā","verse_key":"21:24"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ذِكْرُ","en_gloss":"(is) a Reminder","transliteration":"dhik'ru","verse_key":"21:24"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"(for those) who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"21:24"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مَّعِىَ","en_gloss":"(are) with me","transliteration":"maʿiya","verse_key":"21:24"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَذِكْرُ","en_gloss":"and a Reminder","transliteration":"wadhik'ru","verse_key":"21:24"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"(for those) who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"21:24"},{"pos":15,"ar":"قَبْلِى ۗ","en_gloss":"(were) before me","transliteration":"qablī","verse_key":"21:24"},{"pos":16,"ar":"بَلْ","en_gloss":"But","transliteration":"bal","verse_key":"21:24"},{"pos":17,"ar":"أَكْثَرُهُمْ","en_gloss":"most of t